            "from": 0,
            "to": 1,
            "link": "The discussion on crop rotation sets the context for the need for proper land preparation, which is why the mowboard plow is mentioned next."
          },
          {
            "from": 1,
            "to": 2,
            "link": "After preparing the land, the next step is to improve the soil quality, which is why compost made from horse manure, wood shavings, and chicken manure is added."
          },
          {
            "from": 2,
