            "link": "The initial cultivation of the land is done using a laly-tine weeder to prepare the soil for planting."
          },
          {
            "from": 3,
            "to": 4,
            "link": "Once the corn plants are established, the farm all H cultivating machine is used to manage the soil around the plants."
          },
          {
            "from": 4,
            "to": 5,
            "link": "To ensure consistent soil management, the farm all C machine is used as a backup or alternative to the farm all H machine when necessary."
          }
